header><h1>Evaluate Expression</h1></header><div class=3D"style_problemDesc=
ription__T4cPe"><p>Given a string representing a mathematical expression co=
ntaining integers, parentheses, addition, and subtraction operators, evalua=
te and return the result of the expression.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Example:<=
/h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">Input: s =3D <span class=3D"h=
