<p>Consider another problem in this chapter that also contains parentheses:=
 <em>Valid Parenthesis Expression</em>. In that problem, we used a <strong>=
stack</strong> to process nested parentheses in the right order. This sugge=
sts a stack might also help us evaluate nested expressions in the right ord=
er. Let=E2=80=99s explore this idea further.</p>
<p>Similar to <em>Valid Parenthesis Expression</em>, an opening parenthesis=
 =E2=80=98<code>(</code>=E2=80=98 indicates the start of a new nested expre=
ssion, whereas a closing parenthesis =E2=80=98<code>)</code>=E2=80=99 indic=
ates the end of one. Understanding this, let=E2=80=99s try to use a stack t=
o solve the following expression.</p>
